# Dxun, Freedon Nadd's tomb, and the Basilisk to Iziz (TSL, 411DXN, 403DXN,
# 511OND): still as Visas Marr's squad, Xarga on the tomb, the Sith Captain
# sending his sparring warriors, the two barriers, the Dark Jedi
# Apprentices at the sealed tomb door, the east wing's beast trainers and
# the Ancient Terminal's lever (the door unlocked), the Sith Captain and his
# troopers, the ritual broken: the Sith Master's temptation refused (3 LSP,
# "I will not... be tempted") and the Sith Master and Dark Jedi Masters
# fought, Freedon Nadd's sarcophagus and mummy searched; Xarga takes the
# squad back (a_leave_411: the Exile the player again). At the camp Zuka's
# salvaged Basilisk War Droid, the party screen (Kreia forced, Mandalore
# taken), and the drop into Iziz's ruined Merchant Quarter.
# Starts from the Jungle Tomb's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @dxun_sith_tomb data/routes/tsl/finale_sith_tomb.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Tomb of Freedon Nadd" and "Onderon Civil War";
# GameBanshee 50 (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# Left: the side rooms past the entrance (SW: grenadiers, the broken
# medical droid, puzz_sw; SE: war droids, the workbench, the broken droid,
# puzz_se, the Dark Side Energy taint_ds), the west wing (its Ancient
# Terminal does what the east one does; the second Dark Side Energy,
# taint_ds2: a Will save, a DSP on failing it), the Sith Master's loot.
#
# ASSUMES:
# - The squad is Visas Marr leading, Bao-Dur and Atton; the Exile and Kreia
#   wait at the camp (403DXN_PARTY2_NPC1..3 = 9, 1, 0).
# - Xarga's tomb talk (start 0) starts itself on entering: k_411_enter has
#   xarga start a conversation. # UNSURE: it may wait for tr_intro_dlg.
# - sw_door and se_door ("Barrier", KeyRequired, not Locked) open to a use.
# - The tomb door (sarc_door, locked, plot) opens to the east Ancient
#   Terminal's lever (a_open_door).
# - Xarga's last talk (start 1) comes at tr_leave_411 once the ritual is
#   broken. # UNSURE: who starts it.
# - Zuka's Basilisk talk starts itself in 403DXN (k_403_enter, the
#   411DXN_Complete branch: Zuka to wp_basilisk_zuka, then his talk).
# - a_to_iziz's party screen forces Kreia (NPC 6); Mandalore (2) is added
#   (AddAvailableNPCByTemplate p_mand) and taken, as DSimpson does.
#   # UNSURE: which of a_to_iziz's two ShowPartySelectionGUI calls runs
#   (one forces 2, the other 6); `party 6,2` answers either.
# - a_to_iziz2 plays OndMov07 and starts 511OND at From_403DXN.
talk                 # Xarga: the Tomb of Freedon Nadd (411xarga start 0)
to tr_intro_dlg      # the Sith Captain and his sparring warriors (sithcapt)
talk
fight 40
use sw_door          # the first barrier (k_door_airlock)
fight 40
use se_door          # the second barrier
fight 40             # the Dark Jedi Apprentices before the tomb door
use nw_door@1        # the east wing
fight 40
to tr_beast_tamer    # the Sith training boma (beast_ta)
talk
fight 40
say [Lower lever.]
use anc_terminal     # the east Ancient Terminal: the tomb door unlocked
fight 40             # attacked again on the way back
use sarc_door        # the inner tomb
to tr_ritual_sc_1    # the ritual: the Sith Captain sent out (ritlead start 0)
talk
fight 40             # the Sith Captain and his troopers
say I will not walk the path of the dark side! # ritlead start 1
say It's not too late for you. You can come back to the light.
say I will not... be tempted. That path leads to the dark side. # (3 LSP)
to tr_ritual_sc_2    # the ritual broken
talk
fight 40             # the Sith Master and the Dark Jedi Masters
use d_sithsarc       # Freedon Nadd's sarcophagus
use corpse           # his mummy: Freedon Nadd's Short Lightsaber
say I'm ready to go. What happened with # Xarga start 1
to tr_leave_411
talk
module 403dxn        # a_leave_411: the Exile again, From_411DXN2
party 6,2            # Kreia (forced) and Mandalore into the Basilisk
say =I'm ready to go. # Zuka: the Basilisk War Droid
talk
module 511ond        # a_to_iziz2: OndMov07, From_403DXN
save onderon_civil_war
